{"id":"5b787c2d91128a43","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/913_Residuated_Logic.md","title":"913 Residuated Logic","display":"913_Residuated_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"913-Residuated-Logic\">913 Residuated Logic</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}\\)</span> 五个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Residuated Logic 的目标特征是只含乘积及左右残余，不含格交、格并或结构交换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rres}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rres}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{lres}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{lres}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rres}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{rres}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\)</span>，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\sigma)=A[\\sigma]\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\sigma)=A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，并令：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{prod}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{lres}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{lres}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rres}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rres}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{rres}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{rres}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限原子集、绑定名函数与新原子选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Res}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Res}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-上下文、洞与序列\">3. 上下文、洞与序列</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，空列表为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span>，连接为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\">\\(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\{(U,V):U,V\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\{(U,V):U,V\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}((U,V),\\Gamma)=U\\cdot\\Gamma\\cdot V.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}((U,V),\\Gamma)=U\\cdot\\Gamma\\cdot V.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\{\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A:\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{(A)\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{(A)\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{1}=\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{one}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{1}=\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{one}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-残余规则\">5. 残余规则</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\)</span> 上的有限列集合。以下规则关系均是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的子集。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod R}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod R}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\Delta\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,(A,B))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,(A,B))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,(\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\epsilon)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,(\\operatorname{one}))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\epsilon)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,(\\operatorname{one}))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\operatorname{one})\">\\((\\operatorname{one})\\)</span> 是填入列表洞的单元素上下文，所以该关系是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{(((A)\\cdot\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}=\\{(((A)\\cdot\\Gamma\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\Gamma\\cdot(A)\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rres}(B,A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}=\\{((\\Gamma\\cdot(A)\\Rightarrow B);\\Gamma\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{rres}(B,A)):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,(B))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\Gamma\\cdot(\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,(B))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\Gamma\\cdot(\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,(B))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,(\\operatorname{rres}(B,A))\\cdot\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,(B))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,(\\operatorname{rres}(B,A))\\cdot\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,(A))\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,(A))\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\Gamma)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Res}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>本节及后续证明索引的节点集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 限定为有限序数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T=n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\qquad n\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad n&gt;0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T=n=\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\},\\qquad n\\in\\mathbb N,\\quad n&gt;0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>所有子节点列均为有限函数，其相等取函数外延相等。带直接边、子列和标号的候选对象有固定集合界</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{TreeCode}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&gt;0}\n\\{n\\}\\times n\\times\\mathcal P(n\\times n)\n\\times(n^{&lt;\\omega})^n\\times(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}})^n,\n\\qquad n^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}n^k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{TreeCode}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\n=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N,\\ n&gt;0}\n\\{n\\}\\times n\\times\\mathcal P(n\\times n)\n\\times(n^{&lt;\\omega})^n\\times(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}})^n,\n\\qquad n^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}n^k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明仅取其中满足下文明列树条件和节点许可的对象。若原证明记法省略直接边分量，该分量由子列恢复；若把树与标号组成二元组，取上述集合的相应重组像。因此每个固定根判断的证明与证书索引都是集合。</p>\n<p>任意以有限非空集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 为节点的相同规则树均可重编码：取双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:U\\to n\">\\(b:U\\to n\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"r_b=b(r),\\qquad\n\\prec_b=\\{(b(u),b(v)):u\\prec v\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[r_b=b(r),\\qquad\n\\prec_b=\\{(b(u),b(v)):u\\prec v\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}_b(b(u))(i)=b(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)),\n\\qquad\n\\ell_b(b(u))=\\ell(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ch}_b(b(u))(i)=b(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)),\n\\qquad\n\\ell_b(b(u))=\\ell(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>双射保持根、唯一父节点、到根路径、无环性、子列次序及全部节点标签；每个局部规则的前提列和结论逐项相同，故许可与根判断保持。反向把有限序数视为有限集合即得原形状的证明；这里改变节点编码，不改变存在证明的可导关系。</p>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\">\\(T^{&lt;\\omega}=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}T^n\\)</span>。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)\">\\(\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)\\)</span> 为所有五元组</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的集合，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是非空有限集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 的值无重复项，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 出现在\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(v)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(v)\\)</span> 中当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\prec v\">\\(u\\prec v\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\ne r\">\\(u\\ne r\\)</span> 有唯一父节点，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且每个节点沿有限链到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>根标记为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(r)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(r)=\\Gamma\\Rightarrow A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(v)=()\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(v)=()\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell(v)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell(v)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(v)=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{m-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(v)=(v_0,\\ldots,v_{m-1})\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(v_0),\\ldots,\\ell(v_{m-1}));\\ell(v)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(v_0),\\ldots,\\ell(v_{m-1}));\\ell(v)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可导性\">7. 可导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Res}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Res}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明证书集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}}(\\Gamma,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>残余差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\n=(\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\n=(\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\prod R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{1L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{/R},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\backslash L},\\mathsf{Rule}_{/L}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Res}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Res}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Res}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Ctx}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{LHole}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Res}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Res}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义乘积和左右残余的句法证明关系；不含格连接、代数语义对象或完备性结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"913-Residuated-Logic","text":"913 Residuated Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-上下文、洞与序列","text":"3. 上下文、洞与序列","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理","text":"4. 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-残余规则","text":"5. 残余规则","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导性","text":"7. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{prod},\\operatorname{lres},\\operatorname{rres}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{prod}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lres}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}},","display":true},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Res}}\\Rightarrow\\operat